    "detailed_description": "<h1>How to play together</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>1. LOCALLY - the intended experience</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect as many controllers as there are players and you're ready to go!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>2. ONLINE, using Steam Remote Play Together - results will depend on internet speed</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the game running, open the Steam overlay (Shift + Tab) and simply invite friends through the Remote Play Together tab. <strong>Only the host needs to have the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/9dc5bbadddbb1d8736bf89167304a956.avif?t=1739197496\" width=166 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: this system only permits one keyboard device, so all but one player will still need to use controllers.)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/8de65a48461e3b5fcb32d9d0ec0c5eb1.poster.avif?t=1739197496\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/8de65a48461e3b5fcb32d9d0ec0c5eb1.webm?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/8de65a48461e3b5fcb32d9d0ec0c5eb1.mp4?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Manners Be Damned!&quot;</strong> is a couch co-op party game in which you and up to 7 friends will compete in platforming challenges set in an ancient, deadly temple. The only tools you\u2019ll have are your fancy canes - great for pushing each other into trouble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/3fdf355dbd4273a775d9939ca26b7def.poster.avif?t=1739197496\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/3fdf355dbd4273a775d9939ca26b7def.webm?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/3fdf355dbd4273a775d9939ca26b7def.mp4?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry! Death is cheap - so play it fast and loose to try and get any advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/bcc035d91c48dfedc42ee9f08be837a1.poster.avif?t=1739197496\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/bcc035d91c48dfedc42ee9f08be837a1.webm?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/bcc035d91c48dfedc42ee9f08be837a1.mp4?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points for your speed, agility and cane wielding mastery to prove you are the best gentleman!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/1fdc3f2c70d1da14141feeb6994e4c5e.poster.avif?t=1739197496\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/1fdc3f2c70d1da14141feeb6994e4c5e.webm?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/1fdc3f2c70d1da14141feeb6994e4c5e.mp4?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op for up to 8 players (online play available with Steam Remote Play Together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 distinct game modes (&quot;King of the Hat&quot; and &quot;Temple Dash&quot;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilarious player interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100% voice-recorded SFX </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible for all ages and skill levels </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GIVE US FEEDBACK!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Manners Be Damned!&quot;</strong> is still in active development, so we'd love to hear your first impressions and any feedback you might have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave a review, or tell us directly in Discord!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/5d8b1d54aba3aa13572487d298d4e5b2.poster.avif?t=1739197496\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/5d8b1d54aba3aa13572487d298d4e5b2.webm?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/5d8b1d54aba3aa13572487d298d4e5b2.mp4?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The link to join the Discord can be found on the right, amongst other info (or below, if you are on mobile).</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/8de65a48461e3b5fcb32d9d0ec0c5eb1.poster.avif?t=1739197496\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/8de65a48461e3b5fcb32d9d0ec0c5eb1.webm?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/8de65a48461e3b5fcb32d9d0ec0c5eb1.mp4?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Manners Be Damned!&quot;</strong> is a couch co-op party game in which you and up to 7 friends will compete in platforming challenges set in an ancient, deadly temple. The only tools you\u2019ll have are your fancy canes - great for pushing each other into trouble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/3fdf355dbd4273a775d9939ca26b7def.poster.avif?t=1739197496\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/3fdf355dbd4273a775d9939ca26b7def.webm?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/3fdf355dbd4273a775d9939ca26b7def.mp4?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t worry! Death is cheap - so play it fast and loose to try and get any advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/bcc035d91c48df