iew, or tell us directly in Discord!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/5d8b1d54aba3aa13572487d298d4e5b2.poster.avif?t=1739197496\" width=616 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/5d8b1d54aba3aa13572487d298d4e5b2.webm?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/5d8b1d54aba3aa13572487d298d4e5b2.mp4?t=1739197496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The link to join the Discord can be found on the right, amongst other info (or below, if you are on mobile).</p>",
